{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんごっ(o・・o)\nさゆりんごっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、母音ってすごいなぁって感じます。\n母音すごいよ、母音"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あいうえお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この方たちがいなきゃ\n日本語は成り立たん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かぁきぃくぅけぇこぉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこにでも登場するやん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁゆぅりぃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたいの名前も母音が隠れてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"aiueo"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母音最強やん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど母音同士の言葉って少ないんよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あい、あお、いえ、うえ、ぐらいかしら∩( ・ω・)∩？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"此奴ら最強なり！二倍の力や！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中でもやっぱり\n５０音を仕切ってる「あ」は\nやばいね∩( ・ω・)∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＴＯＰはってますわ∩( ・ω・)∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＢＡＤBOYSで言ったら\n段野さんかしら∩( ・ω・)∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"司くんは優しいから\n「ま」かしら∩( ・ω・)∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあヒロさんは\n愉快な方やから\n「た」かな∩( ・ω・)∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最早、母音の話ちゃうな∩( ・ω・)∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん的には\nどなたがどれかしら∩( ・ω・)∩？\n映画館でチェックやぁ∩( ・ω・)∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにしても\n母音はすごい∩( ・ω・)∩\nすごいって言葉にも\nやばいって言葉にも\n母音が出てくる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ形容詞的なあれかっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんくるないさ～∩( ・ω・)∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母音いいなっ\n無くてはならない存在\n何物にも変えがたい\nけど、いることに違和感がない\n上手くみんなに溶け込んでる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母音いいなっ∩( ・ω・)∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅんは乃木坂の母音になろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の母音っ(o・・o)\n松村沙友理ですっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから目標聞かれたら\n母音になることですっ！って言おう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対、「は？」ってなるやろけど∩( ・ω・)∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも母音目指そう(๑°ㅁ°๑)‼✧\n母音最強だがやっ(๑°ㅁ°๑)‼✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、強要はしやん(๑°ㅁ°๑)‼✧\nみんなも好きなの目指そうっ(๑°ㅁ°๑)‼✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「か」目指しても\n「ね」目指してもええんよ(๑°ㅁ°๑)‼✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅんの「ま」でも\nなんでもええんよ₍₍ ◝( ˙ ꒳ ˙ )◟ ⁾⁾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、むしろ\nひらがなやなくても\nええくらいやわな₍₍ ◝( ˙ ꒳ ˙ )◟ ⁾⁾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ु˙꒳ ˙)ुさ　( ੭˙꒳ ˙)੭むいー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ु˙꒳ ˙)ुさ　( ੭˙꒳ ˙)੭むいー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2013/11/30/1602938/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ु˙꒳ ˙)ुさ　( ੭˙꒳ ˙)੭むいー\nばいならヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"}],"source":"archive"}